      "description": "A cultural phenomenon observed annually on April 1st, where people play practical jokes and create humorous hoaxes. The text 'april fools!' in the meme explicitly references this day, indicating the joke is meant to be understood as a prank, not a serious accusation. This requires external knowledge of the holiday's context and conventions to interpret the meme's intent correctly.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
