      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "political_satire",
      "label": "Political Satire",
      "description": "A genre of humor that uses irony, exaggeration, or ridicule to critique or mock political figures, institutions, or events. The meme's juxtaposition of a confident political figure with the text 'caught telling the truth!' is a form of political satire that relies on the audience's familiarity with political discourse and the tendency to scrutinize politicians' statements. This requires external knowledge of satire as a cultural and rhetorical tool.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_2be88f4a"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
