      "instance_name": "humor",
      "label": "the humorous emotion",
      "description": "The emotion expressed is humor, conveyed through the juxtaposition of Hillary Clinton's confident, smiling expression with the satirical text 'hillary clinton caught telling the truth!' and the clarifying 'april fools!' tag. The overall context of the meme is a joke, relying on irony and the absurdity of 'catching' a politician telling the truth, which is revealed as a prank. The visual of Clinton smiling and gesturing enthusiastically adds to the lighthearted, playful tone.",
